// Source: https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/sdk/guides/background-processes/ (code block 15)
// Read 18 October 2026. Copied verbatim; the only change is the package name,
// "@cloudflare/sandbox" -> "withruntime/cloudflare".
// Stop specific process (terminates entire process tree)
await sandbox.killProcess(server.id);

// Force kill if needed
await sandbox.killProcess(server.id, "SIGKILL");

// Stop all processes
await sandbox.killAllProcesses();
